\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Pray, without ceasing pray,
\par Your Captain gives the word;
\par His summons cheerfully obey,
\par And call upon the Lord:
\par To God your every want
\par In istant prayer display;
\par Pray always; pray, and never faint;
\par Pray, without ceasing pray!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In fellowship, alone,
\par To God with faith draw near,
\par Approach His courts, besiege His throne
\par With all the powers of prayer:
\par Go to His temple, go,
\par Nor from His altar move;
\par Let every house His worship know,
\par And every heart His love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Pour out your souls to God,
\par And bow them with your knees,
\par And spread your hearts and hands abroad,
\par And pray for Zion's peace;
\par Your guides and brethren bear
\par For ever on your mind;
\par Extend the arms of mighty prayer,
\par In grasping all mankind.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. From strength to strength go on,
\par Wrestle, and fight, and pray,
\par Tread all the powers of darkness down,
\par And win the well-fought day;
\par Still let the Spirit cry
\par In all His soldiers:Come!
\par Till Christ the Lord descend from high,
\par And  take the conquerors home.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

